# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
# Copy to the published root as `_redirects` (no extension).
#
# Dutch is served from the root, so there is NO rule for `/` — it is a real page.
# Adding one would put a redirect in front of the homepage for every visitor.

# =====================================================================
# THE RULES THAT ACTUALLY MATTER — the live WordPress site being replaced
# =====================================================================
# vonkelektra.nl is currently a live WordPress site with six indexed pages.
# Those URLs carry whatever ranking and inbound links the business already has;
# every one of them 404s the moment this site replaces it unless it is mapped
# here. The rules below are the ONLY ones on this page with real traffic behind
# them — everything further down is prototype housekeeping.
#
# VERIFY THE RIGHT-HAND COLUMN BEFORE DEPLOYING. Three old pages collapse onto
# one new /diensten.html, and which anchor each should land on is a judgement
# call about your own content, not something that can be read off the old site.
#
# This list came from the live navigation. It is not necessarily complete —
# pull the full set from Google Search Console (Pages report) or a crawl of the
# live site before launch, and add anything missing.

/over/                  /over-ons.html                       301
/contact/               /contact.html                        301
/duurzameoplossingen/   /diensten.html#zonnepanelen          301
/elektrawerkzaamheden/  /diensten.html#meterkast             301
/klussenenonderhoud/    /diensten.html#onderhoud             301

# /cookiebeleid — the old cookie policy. The new site sets no cookies, so there
# is nothing to point this at yet. Send it to the privacy page once that exists.
# /cookiebeleid         /privacybeleid.html                  301

# Old WordPress plumbing that Google has crawled and will keep requesting.
/wp-content/*           /                                    301
/wp-admin/*             /                                    301
/feed/                  /                                    301
/?p=*                   /                                    301

# NOTE: www -> apex is NOT handled here. On Netlify/Cloudflare set the primary
# domain in the dashboard instead; the old site links to www.vonkelektra.nl in
# places, so this must be working on day one.

# ============ prototype housekeeping below this line ============

# The old two-folder layout. Keep these for as long as the old URLs have any
# inbound links or index presence; they were live long enough to be crawled.
/nl/                                 /                            301
/nl/index.dc.html                    /                            301
/nl/diensten.dc.html                 /diensten.html               301
/nl/over-ons.dc.html                 /over-ons.html               301
/nl/contact.dc.html                  /contact.html                301
/nl/*                                /:splat                      301

# The design-tool extension, dropped from every filename.
/en/index.dc.html                    /en/                         301
/en/services.dc.html                 /en/services.html            301
/en/about.dc.html                    /en/about.html               301
/en/contact.dc.html                  /en/contact.html             301

# Old prototype filenames, in case any were ever shared or crawled.
/Vonk%20Elektra%20Homepage.dc.html   /                            301
/Services%20&%20Portfolio.dc.html    /diensten.html               301
/About.dc.html                       /over-ons.html               301
/Contact.dc.html                     /contact.html                301

# Convenience aliases people type or print on a van.
/en                                  /en/                         301
/contact                             /contact.html                301
/diensten                            /diensten.html               301
/storing                             /diensten.html#storingsdienst 301
